// Kryspal Media Plugin protocol v1: person alias maps (change 0149).
//
// Capabilities and the methods they map to:
//   people.aliasmap  GetAliasMap
// For capabilities the plugin does not declare, the corresponding calls return UNIMPLEMENTED.
//
// Many metadata sources keep a name map for people: a real name with the stage names, former names and other
// spellings the same person is known by. A plugin that has such a table can hand it to the host as a whole, instead
// of the host learning aliases one person at a time. The host uses it to recognize people by any of their names when
// it scans and scrapes, to find people by any name in search, and as evidence when it looks for duplicate people. The
// host never merges two existing people on its own because of a map: an administrator confirms every merge.

